        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository c1fc7d29-9d37-4836-bdc0-02d693918dd8).Image",
        "Description": "The nose tightens, 47.\rProvidence, in an attempt to decypher your methods, has hired a trio known as &quot;The X Filers&quot; lead by Ms. Mendel, these are stellar criminal profilers who were secretly observing you hunt down most of the agents  just now.\r\rTheir analysis may demystify your techniques!\r\rWe mustn&apos;t allow them to  amass further insight nor let them pass on what they have already found out. Your unpredictability is at stake.\r\rI demand no further casualties, understood?\r\r- oLVa",
